't like ginger. <br/>", "time": "14000"}, {"image": "engenn4le16ob07re2img01.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chef</span>: It gets rid of the heartburn. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Alright, I guess I can try. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef</span>: You have to drink lots. <br/>", "time": "30500"}, {"image": "engenn4le16ob07re2img02.jpg", "id": 5, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  How do I make this?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef</span>: To make ginger tea, you must add one teaspoon of freshly grated ginger to one cup of boiling water. Let it steep for a few minutes. Drink this herbal tea several times a day.<br/>", "time": "39000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le16ob07re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}